WEBVTT

00:09:29.123 --> 00:09:31.640
can change their situation

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:36.360
through peaceful means alone.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:45.731
(Applause)

00:09:45.731 --> 00:09:48.152
Now I know what some of you are thinking.

00:09:48.152 --> 00:09:49.785
The Egyptian people,

00:09:49.785 --> 00:09:53.635
and many other Arabs who've revolted and are in transition,

00:09:53.635 --> 00:09:57.052
have very high expectations of the government.

00:09:57.052 --> 00:10:01.850
They're just victims of a long-time autocracy,